        "original_id": "9b3fde94-2415-54f5-9fde-b610c46701b7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robbie Keane, Hakan Şükür, Christian Vieri, Ronaldo, Olivia O'Toole\n- Organizations: Inter Milan, Republic of Ireland national team\n- Topics: scoring roles, captaincy, international goals records\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2000–01 Inter Milan season, Inter Milan gave the burden of scoring to Hakan Şükür and Robbie Keane while waiting for Christian Vieri's recovery and Ronaldo's return.\n- From March 2006 until his international retirement in August 2016, Robbie Keane served as captain of the Republic of Ireland national team.\n- In September 2012, Robbie Keane equalled Olivia O'Toole's record of 54 international goals.",
